{"id":"bdfdcd6260de99b7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-rule.md","title":"Inference Rule","display":"df-rule — Inference Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-rule","aliases":["57-df-rule"],"display":"df-rule — Inference Rule","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rule — Inference Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S\\)</span> (推理规则类, 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdcd6260de99b7\" href=\"?note=bdfdcd6260de99b7\" title=\"57-df-rule\">57-df-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (元数, arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_k \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_k \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (前提, premises)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (结论, conclusion)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule} \\vdash R \\in \\mathrm{Rule}_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(R : \\mathrm{Fml}_S^k \\to \\mathrm{Fml}_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule} \\vdash R \\in \\mathrm{Rule}_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(R : \\mathrm{Fml}_S^k \\to \\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> premises to one conclusion.</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k = 0\">\\(k = 0\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是<strong>零元规则</strong>，即公理 (axiom)</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k &gt; 0\">\\(k &gt; 0\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是<strong>有前提的规则</strong>，如肯定前件 (Modus Ponens)</li>\n<li>推理规则可表示为自然演绎风格：<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi_1 \\quad \\varphi_2 \\quad \\cdots \\quad \\varphi_k}{\\psi}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\varphi_1 \\quad \\varphi_2 \\quad \\cdots \\quad \\varphi_k}{\\psi}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-rule","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdcd6260de99b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rule}_S$ (推理规则类, 见 [[57-df-rule]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"k \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_k \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule} \\vdash R \\in \\mathrm{Rule}_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(R : \\mathrm{Fml}_S^k \\to \\mathrm{Fml}_S)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k = 0","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"k > 0","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{\\varphi_1 \\quad \\varphi_2 \\quad \\cdots \\quad \\varphi_k}{\\psi}","display":true}],"bytes":938,"backlinks":[{"id":"32599757d6ca82d8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\in S\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}$，见 [[57-df-proof-system]]；$\\mathrm{Rule}_S$ 仍采用 [[57-df-rule]] 的有限元总函数约定。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，见 [[57-df-formula]]。$d$ 是从零起编号的非空公式列；$\\vec j$ 是前提行号列。"},{"id":"e4941b4bb46ac821","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是具有 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 固定编码 $g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 的签名，假定 $\\mathrm{GN}_{57}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\mathrm{Rule}_S$ 见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-rule]]。$W_e$ 见 [[57-df-W-e]]；$g[X]=\\{g(x):x\\in X\\}$ 是函数像。$\\mathcal P$ 为候选有序对，$\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}$ 为其候选分量。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-rig